              Should I buy new or consider a certified refurbished commercial unit at this price?
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              It's worth researching both. Certified refurbished
              commercial treadmills from reputable dealers can sometimes
              deliver similar hardware to what's covered in this guide at
              a lower price, though warranty coverage and condition vary
              significantly by seller, so we'd only recommend that route
              through an established, reputable refurbisher rather than
              an unverified private sale.
            </p>
